<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>如何挑选性格好的猫咪</title>
<script type="text/javascript" id="MathJax-script" async
  src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js">
</script>
<style>
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background: #f5f5f5;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .page {
    width: 550px;
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 18px 16px 20px 16px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .title {
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #111;
    margin: 0 0 14px 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .title .highlight {
    color: #ff3b30;
  }
  .checklist {
    position: relative;
    padding-right: 130px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .checklist ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .checklist li {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #111;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .checkbox {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border: 2px solid #222;
    border-radius: 3px;
    margin-right: 8px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .checkbox::after {
    content: "✓";
    position: absolute;
    top: -4px;
    left: 1px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #222;
    font-weight: 900;
  }
  .cat-placeholder {
    position: absolute;
    top: -10px;
    right: 0;
    width: 130px;
    height: 130px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #fdf3e3, #fdf3e3 10px, #fbeecb 10px, #fbeecb 20px);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #999;
    padding: 6px;
  }
  .section-title {
    background: #ffcb2b;
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #111;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .cat-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    column-gap: 8px;
    row-gap: 22px;
  }
  .cat-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .cat-photo {
    width: 92px;
    height: 92px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #fbeecb;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #a08a5a;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4px;
  }
  .cat-name {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #111;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .cat-name::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 15%;
    right: 15%;
    bottom: -2px;
    height: 6px;
    background: #ffcb2b;
    z-index: -1;
  }
  .cat-desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #333;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <h1 class="title">如何挑选<span class="highlight">性格好</span>的猫咪</h1>

  <div class="checklist">
    <ul>
      <li><span class="checkbox"></span>伸手摸它，看会不会主动过来蹭</li>
      <li><span class="checkbox"></span>抱一下猫咪，看会不会抗拒</li>
      <li><span class="checkbox"></span>喂食物，会不会主动积极吃</li>
      <li><span class="checkbox"></span>对猫咪喵喵叫，看会不会积极回应</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="cat-placeholder placeholder">[Illustration: crying cartoon cat, top-right]</div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">猫咪品种看性格</div>

  <div class="cat-grid">
    <div class="cat-card">
      <div class="cat-photo placeholder">[Photo: white Ragdoll cat]</div>
      <div class="cat-name">布偶</div>
      <div class="cat-desc">性格温和，外表美丽<br>肠胃不太好</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cat-card">
      <div class="cat-photo placeholder">[Photo: gray British Shorthair cat]</div>
      <div class="cat-name">英短</div>
      <div class="cat-desc">体型圆胖、毛短而密<br>温柔平静、对人友善</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cat-card">
      <div class="cat-photo placeholder">[Photo: gray tabby American Shorthair cat]</div>
      <div class="cat-name">美短</div>
      <div class="cat-desc">性格活泼好动<br>适应能力也比较强</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cat-card">
      <div class="cat-photo placeholder">[Photo: brown tabby cat]</div>
      <div class="cat-name">狸花</div>
      <div class="cat-desc">身体素质好，聪明<br>好养活，寿命长</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cat-card">
      <div class="cat-photo placeholder">[Photo: Siamese cat]</div>
      <div class="cat-name">暹罗</div>
      <div class="cat-desc">活泼好动，智商高<br>胆子比较大</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cat-card">
      <div class="cat-photo placeholder">[Photo: Munchkin cat]</div>
      <div class="cat-name">曼基康</div>
      <div class="cat-desc">活泼友善，性格好<br>小短腿底盘容易弄脏</div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
